0 @N0210@ NOTE http://www.fredbaltus.nl/rootsmoonen/
1 CONT 
1 CONT 23. Joannes Petrus Moonen (Petrus Arnoldus Moonen , Petrus Moonen , Joan
1 CONC nes ) was born in Nuth - Grijzegrubben (NL). He was christened on 28-08-
1 CONC 1774 in Nuth (NL). He died on 23-05-1848 in Nuth - Nierhoven (NL). Joann
1 CONC es resided in 1836 in Nuth (NL). 
1 CONT 
1 CONT Joannes married Catharina Elisabeth Schoumans daughter of Jacques Schoum
1 CONC ans and Catharina Bruls on 30-04-1800 in Oirsbeek (NL). Catharina was bo
1 CONC rn in Schinnen (NL). She was christened on 02-06-1768 in Schinnen (NL)
1 CONC . She died on 21-04-1837 in Nuth - Grijzegrubben (NL). Catharina reside
1 CONC d in 1836 in Nuth (NL). 
1 CONT 
1 CONT They had the following children: 
1 CONT 
1 CONT   31 F i Maria Catharina Moonen was born on 27-07-1800 in Nuth - Grijzeg
1 CONC rubben (NL). She was christened on 27-07-1800 in Nuth (NL).  
1 CONT         Maria married Christian Scheres son of Wilhelmus Scheres and Mar
1 CONC ia Agaeta Pinckers on 19-10-1826 in Nuth (NL). Christian was born on 27-
1 CONC 11-1789 in Oud Valkenburg (NL).  
1 CONT + 32 M ii Pieter Jacobus Monen was born on 14-04-1802.  
1 CONT + 33 M iii Jan Moonen was born on 29-12-1804. He died on 24-04-1866.  
1 CONT   34 F iv Catherina Elisabeth Moonen was born on 08-12-1807 in Nuth (NL)
1 CONC . She died on 18-10-1843 in Schinnen (NL).  
1 CONT         Catherina married Pieter Seijpers son of Casper Lambert Seijper
1 CONC s and Marij Catharijn Lenssen on 10-10-1836 in Nuth (NL). Pieter was bor
1 CONC n on 18-06-1807 in Schinnen (NL).  
1 CONT   35 F v Maria Christina Moonen was born on 24-04-1811 in Nuth (NL). Mar
1 CONC ia resided in 1836 in Nuth (NL).  
1 CONT         Maria married Johannes Drumen son of Jacobus Drumen and Maria Ca
1 CONC tharina Sperts on 03-06-1836 in Meerssen (NL). Johannes was born on 17-1
1 CONC 0-1807 in Berg (NL). Johannes resided in 1836 in Nuth (NL).  
1 CONT + 36 M vi Jan Willem Moonen was born on 08-01-1815.
